Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish If you want it,\Ngotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marked maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead to new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No one told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought smiles were just a\Nkind of man-made Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Yasui, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't fast enough. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're going to riot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You stood right before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I didn't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I should commit sepulchre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasui.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know Yasuhu's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my lord, Yasuhu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was taken too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I missing something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The people from Ebisu Town loved him\Nso much, why would they be laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a sick bastard, Orji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You must think this is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those poor chumps are crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,laughing their asses off at\Nthe death of their old daimyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a bastard, Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe it, sir,\NYasui—he was alive all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,years He knew about our strategy, and\Nhe knew that the enemy had thwarted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Yasui, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You let them seize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sacrifice has\Ngiven us another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some reason, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody deserves to be\Nlaughed at when they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is due to the side\Neffects of the Smilefruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They are here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,People who can only laugh\Neven when they're sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been gone a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.74,0:05:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the words Smilefruit ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The smiles that the people of\NEbisu wear, they are merely masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Masks that they can never\Nremove till they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Orochi began this\Noperation a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They started importing some\Nkind of artificial fruit in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,exchange for the weapons that\Nare made in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The smile fruits, when you\Neat those wretched things,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you invite the hatred of the sea and\Ncan no longer swim but in return you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,gain the strength of a wild beast and\Ntheir fearsome appearance as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,all that stuff checks\Nout with what we know a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,while back we destroyed\Nthe factory that made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:07:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know master keen did mention that but\Ntheir plan had gone on for quite some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The damage had been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A great number of fruits have\Nbeen brought to our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's objective was to\Nstrengthen his ranks by giving
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,that beastly power to as many\Nof his underlings as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted the strongest pirate\Ncrew the world had ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's always a catch when\Nsomething sounds too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The success rate of that artificial\Nstrength enhancer was only 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So if 10 people ate one of those fruits,\Nonly one of them would gain an ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The other nine would face the consequences\Nwithout gaining anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, they won't\Nbe able to swim anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but the flawed chemical\Nmixture causes another effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who fail to inherit the power lose\Ntheir ability to express sorrow or anger;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,all they can do is laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What so the chemical\Nmixture she mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the sad stuff that\NCaesar was working on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew it was bad news, but this\Nis pretty sick even for Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido doesn't care; he'll\Nsacrifice as many minutes he must.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wants that power,\Nno matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's crew is divided\Ninto three categories;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of the fruit\Ndetermines your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who haven't eaten\None and are hoping for a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,chance to gain a beast\Npower are called waiters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The lucky members who beat the odds and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,successfully gained the\Npower are the gifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And the unlucky ones who\Nate the fruit and were left
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,with nothing but endless\Nlaughter are the pleasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems that Kaido and his twisted\Nassociates found their condition amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,their creation was named\Nin mockery of the only
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,expression the pleasures were\Ncapable of making anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed odd to me,\Ncalling the fruits that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never thought it would\Nhave such a cruel story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys really are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, that's\Nnot even the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi came up with a\Nwicked plan when he noticed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,most smile fruits were\Ndiscarded after a single
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't produce gifters, but they\Nstill passed on the negative side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So if he wanted to turn people into\Npleasures out of cruelty, then he could...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:09:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside of the Capital, as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,is the town of leftovers, where people\Nwere crying and dying of hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day, Orochi was disgusted\Nby the sight of their suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So he mixed in the\Nfailed smile fruits with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the deliveries that came from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing full well how they would react.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So many apples, and they're still fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a treat—let's share everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, after the first few times, they\Nknew exactly what they were getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But what choice did they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They were starving after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and their empty stomachs were\Nheedless to the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus Ebisertown was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a place of sickness and poverty\Nwhere everyone wears a smile, no
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,matter how they suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The tragic place haunted by laughter,\Nwhere children can't even mourn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the death of their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So please,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,don't blame them for laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones hurting, most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the living creatures in the\Nworld, Only a human can laugh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of all, it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So why waste a beautiful thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all his fault
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,he did this for the sake of cruelty
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he robs them of all their joy then\Nrobs them of their ability to breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's too much if this isn't hell
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What more can he take
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how happy they are to see you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasui A fitting aim You knew this\Nwas my country How arrogant to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,think that I would ever let you live\NYou're lucky you lasted so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hog But now You're just a dead rat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And there you have it everybody,\Nyour beloved old daimyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the famous Shimotsu\NKiyosui is lying face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,dead in the dirt like the\Nmiserable vermin he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now laugh your asses off, because\Nwe're all so happy to see him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the land of Wano,\Na bright and joyful place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you might even mistake it for heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep laughing! More! More!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go? Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Dock, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some medicine that'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She came and ate Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying she's\NTonoyasu's daughter? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you back. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This medicine here will heal any wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.12,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This toad oil works just like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend who sells it told me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Otoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't perform miracles at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lucky day?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Get
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Yasue's daughter as clear as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else could be so insolent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You little rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't laughed at\Nme like a damned fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then Komurasaki would\Nstill be alive right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wretched family has been\Na pain in my ass for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose you as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'll have my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zorojuro the Magistrate\NKiller and Sangoro the Sabo Cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are always itching for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm just glad Otoko is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward\Nto this execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you interrupt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Shogun wants someone dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if that brat wasn't Yasue's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She still committed an unforgivable crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill all of that filthy rat's allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyone else who\Ntries to get in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, those guys are\Npointing right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that we should run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Scatter, you bunch of roaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.96,0:20:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't have\Ntime for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get out of my way, Browgoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sangoro, stupid, and you\Nstay out of my way, Masjuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Masjuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, because your\Nhead looks like a moss ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Does not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll chop you to pieces right\Nalong with Odorchi. Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll kick you to death\Nright along with Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Otaku, thank goodness she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That man, could he be Zoro Juro's friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The swordman is definitely\NZoro, so that's one Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The other is Vince Mokesanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange wanted poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps all of the Straw Hats\Nare here in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not very subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Defying the Shogun right\Nin the middle of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says we need to be subtle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be as loud as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, don't ever call me\Na Vinsmoke again. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure they leave\Nit off your gravestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to keep at it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Next row.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Odako and run already, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those thugs really are\Nquite stubborn, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's better if you\Ntake her. Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need all that ronin with bullets\Nbefore he tries to attack me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.70,0:22:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Browgoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to\Ncut through my bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.70,0:22:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sucker trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be satisfied\Ntill I end you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mosshead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one calling the shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonyasu gave his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a firm believer in good old balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good and evil, black and\Nwhite, odds and evens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You really knocked him good,\Nso let's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about our secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:23:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In this country, we have a name\Nfor our trademark grin. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.26,0:23:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We proudly call it the Ebisu Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's where the place gets its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Poverty can't steal our smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me the Akasaya\Nput him up to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, useless samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,720-caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is that below that\Nis boss Kiyoshiro, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.88,0:23:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are far too careless; the execution\Nsite clearly lacks the security you require.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.62,0:23:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That ronin truly is a menace—I\Nswear he was trying to murder me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.04,0:24:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moss Head, what the\Nhell are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get us all killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Something
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,so big—sneak up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,on me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire on my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more executions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.86,0:24:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.10,0:24:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just sit here\Nand watch this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.44,0:24:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta step in and throw down, bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I object.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.74,0:24:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot afford to endanger\Nour plan any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.12,0:24:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we'll become\Ncriminals if we fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we won't be able\Nto act in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I can't allow them to\Nput Lord Yasui's body on display.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.52,0:25:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Preserving his honor\Nis the least we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I disagree, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.78,0:25:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.54,0:25:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should all of us\Nmeet once things cool off?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.72,0:25:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm staying here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.72,0:25:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is far too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.32,0:25:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot speak for the others, but Lord\NOdin's allies must remain discreet for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.65,0:25:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You two should keep a low profile and head
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.80,0:25:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,out while the enemy is\Nstill distracted but I,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.52,0:25:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,our crew started this mess so\Nwe'll take care of it, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.40,0:25:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're used to this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.62,0:25:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall leave this in\Ntheir capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.02,0:25:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the Shogun back to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.30,0:25:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop until they're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Every fool who opposes me must be\Ndealt with swiftly and violently!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.50,0:25:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.68,0:25:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And he comes up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he good proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's just a carpenter
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time! Can you dig it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did these people come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.69,0:26:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that guy stole Lord Yasui's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is\Nthat guy planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.96,0:26:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.30,0:26:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give your buddy a proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.18,0:26:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.09,0:26:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.01,0:26:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.10,0:26:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've known it was you, Usohachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.12,0:26:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice save!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot that man on top of the ladder!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.42,0:26:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can't snipe the sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.04,0:26:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be too ironic!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.56,0:26:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mille Bellamy, Gigantesco Narno, and Face!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.42,0:27:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a ton, Oroby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.56,0:27:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how many allies do these people have?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.40,0:27:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, it's that\Ngeisha from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.98,0:27:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So she is a magic user.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.26,0:27:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,These are powerful enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.26,0:27:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.44,0:27:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Honami, leave them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.42,0:27:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.06,0:27:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut through!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.94,0:27:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Shogun's loyal dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:28:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up for you, Spector!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.08,0:28:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.98,0:28:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner we leave, the better. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, godless combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Leel's Lord, he can death for Marlowe!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.76,0:28:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tornado temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone nearby, we need aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.88,0:28:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A group of rebels are\Nrioting in Rasetsu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.60,0:28:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun said he wants\Nthem dead or alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in with the intent to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.70,0:28:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick their asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.22,0:29:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, those people showing on\Nthe display, are they your crewmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.48,0:29:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I shouldn't cheer,\Nit's supposed to be a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.16,0:29:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's probably okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.78,0:29:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.14,0:29:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice! Like that! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.70,0:29:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Zorojuro! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.32,0:29:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So that moss head dude is\Nyour friend, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.84,0:29:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the magistrate killer, Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be part of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.52,0:29:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.82,0:29:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This maniac thinks he can\Nget away with killing Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.02,0:29:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.93,0:29:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo! Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the room man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.00,0:29:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good But sir a new\Nprisoner just arrived and he's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.38,0:29:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a famous killer from the flower\Ncapital Should I know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you give me a hint, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to see him in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.94,0:29:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think He'll be coming through there
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.12,0:30:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun lost patience with this piece
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.54,0:30:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,of trash after failing\Nan important mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.44,0:30:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Oroji said he's worse than useless,\Nso you can punish him however you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Head Kirikamazo, the famous killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's who you are, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.84,0:30:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.14,0:30:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.66,0:30:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, stop there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.10,0:30:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him while we were\Nescorting Kamizo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And luckily, he wasn't too tough to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.06,0:30:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Kidd is back where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.34,0:30:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.98,0:31:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He was yelling something or other,\Nbut I wasn't about to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I pulled out\Nmy gun and shot him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.10,0:31:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even try to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.42,0:31:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he forgot he had those cuffs\Non and still thought he was tough
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.78,0:31:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You dunce, that's almost cute kid
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.04,0:31:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have been easy\Nto break out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.44,0:31:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So why would he just surrender himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.84,0:31:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.80,0:31:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.74,0:31:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.65,0:31:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.94,0:31:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dammit! I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.10,0:31:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You always hated your laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.92,0:31:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You never laughed out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.58,0:31:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't stand to let\Nanyone hear it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.28,0:31:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And if someone out there was stupid\Nenough to make fun of your laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.96,0:32:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd beat the bastards half to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.70,0:32:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.70,0:32:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You started wearing a mask because you\Ndidn't even like to show your face, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.78,0:32:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the man I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.38,0:32:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.02,0:32:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no clue what happened\Nafter we were separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.48,0:32:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Kaido do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Horichi, where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.74,0:32:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.84,0:32:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.20,0:32:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,KILLER!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.23,0:32:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.14,0:32:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be the guy he was with before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.28,0:32:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaggy must have got caught\Nwhen he tried to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.36,0:32:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He suffered a cruel fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.74,0:32:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave him a smile fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.50,0:33:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all of his emotions are locked away,\Nhidden behind a mask of endless laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.70,0:33:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, you really are\Na heartless monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.04,0:33:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell did\Nthose bastards do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.52,0:33:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.12,0:33:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.10,0:33:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever takes this won't pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.10,0:33:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.68,0:33:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.24,0:33:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.52,0:34:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why you don't screw with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.12,0:34:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't take orders\Nfrom you, Pipsqueak.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I came up with a\Nlittle game to live things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.64,0:34:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept you all waiting, but\Nthe party's back on track now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.28,0:34:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumo Inferno, round two!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.32,0:34:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.64,0:34:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've added a new rule to\Nspice things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.52,0:35:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll still be fighting\Nagainst countless opponents,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.26,0:35:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and the spikes in your\Ncollars will still kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.80,0:35:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,if you step outside of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.70,0:35:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, that hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.36,0:35:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you're still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.60,0:35:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the runaway and his happy\Nlittle pal will be drowning
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.44,0:35:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in that tank there you\Nget it if you want them
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.90,0:35:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to come out of the water\Nyou gotta lose your head
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.04,0:35:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you and the old man that's\Nstupid they're not my
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.10,0:35:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,crew they have nothing to\Ndo with me I don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.26,0:35:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,cuz you seem pretty angry\Nso even if you aren't crew
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,mates they must mean\Nsomething to you it must be
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.24,0:35:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,because your rivals from\Nthe same generation right
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.58,0:35:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,well if you're such a kind and\Ncharitable person you can die
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.44,0:35:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,anytime and save them but i'd make\Nit quick if i were you a little
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.48,0:35:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,water goes a long way even if\Nyou're a famous pirate it only takes
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.86,0:36:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,five centimeters to drown and no\None can hold their breath forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.48,0:36:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let the games begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.98,0:36:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.68,0:36:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get in here and fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.04,0:36:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass and settle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.42,0:36:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of your games!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.24,0:37:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one calling the shots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My house, my rules, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.54,0:37:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now sit your ass down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.43,0:37:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.86,0:37:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.86,0:37:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.32,0:37:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see what makes you so hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.84,0:37:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was never possible for either of\Nyou to make it out of this place alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope isn't an option, only despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.78,0:38:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an execution, you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.84,0:38:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.14,0:38:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't decide where I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.50,0:38:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.26,0:39:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.04,0:39:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.50,0:39:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Queen, we lost contact\Nwith the guards outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.88,0:39:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.38,0:40:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's my suit?
